{"id":"655658","name":"油泼饺子","author":"和月香","authorId":"12842754","desc":"","cover":"images/655658/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"手工饺子","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"小香葱","amount":"3根"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"2瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"按自家饭量准备饺子，现包的饺子、冷冻的饺子皆可，我今天包了萝卜猪肉馅的饺子。","img":"images/655658/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"葱切葱花、蒜切末。","img":"images/655658/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"调料提前备好，省得手忙脚乱。","img":"images/655658/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中添水，水开下水饺，点2次凉水，煮熟捞入碗中。","img":"images/655658/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加葱花、蒜末。","img":"images/655658/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入调料。","img":"images/655658/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把烧好的热油“滋啦”一声泼在上面。","img":"images/655658/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"根据自己的口味加生抽、米醋，拌匀。","img":"images/655658/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"每个饺子都沾满了香喷喷的调料。","img":"images/655658/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"看着就有食欲。","img":"images/655658/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"鲜香酸辣。","img":"images/655658/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"聊咋咧👍🏻","img":"images/655658/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}